"""rules.py: what each finding code means and what to do about it.

One place for the explanations, used by the SARIF export (so GitHub shows advice next to each alert) and by docs/CHECKS.md (generated by
tools/make_checks_doc.py). tests/test_rules.py fails if a finding code is added to the program without an entry here.

RULES[code] = (name, advice, CWE ids)
"""
